  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 07 01 02 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 0B}那、那个！\n我也可以参加吗……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_500.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
